        "slc_e76f7108156dd2d9bd4e0638d708441771f0a30c5edc0f9d04b1a48cf24541c6"
      ],
      "text": "The tool offers a TUI with ask/agent modes and CLI flags including -review, -generate-context, -agent, -config, -dir, and -model."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f3718b27617026f67795f182acf1b56d516be18b29935004a2fbcdd672b7eec9",
