        "slc_c0cb4097ebbf2c99f534e9dc9dceb4c5e837a179847b8173cc4b24fd984c075e"
      ],
      "text": "After applying patches, the tool runs a 'Sanity Check' (currently 'go vet ./...') and shows a project-health indicator for instant feedback."
    },
